{"seq":1,"slug":"smart-dispatch-rule","title":"按距离/能力/容量智能分派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-dispatch/smart-dispatch-rule","wordCount":2769,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"按距离-能力-容量智能分派\">按距离/能力/容量智能分派</h1><p>一张售后单进入系统时，它的候选网点集合可能有一百多个：分布在六个国家，能力各不相同，有的有空工位有的排到两周后，有的手边有料有的要调货。分派器要在几百毫秒内从这一百多个里挑出一个，并且这个选择要能对用户解释、对网点申诉、对成本负责。本篇要处理的就是这个撮合问题——它的核心不是&quot;选最近的那个&quot;，而是<strong>如何把一组量纲完全不同的约束折叠成一个可比的目标函数，同时不让任何一个硬性否决条件被目标函数稀释掉</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分派（dispatch / assignment）在建模上是一道<strong>带硬约束的指派问题</strong>。它的标准形态是：给定待派单集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 与候选网点集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，在满足能力、容量、合规等硬约束的前提下，让一个关于距离、时效、成本、负载的目标函数最小化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[待派单 J] --&gt; B[硬约束过滤: 能力/合规/地域]&#10;    B --&gt; C[硬约束过滤: 容量 ATP &gt; 0]&#10;    C --&gt; D[硬约束过滤: 备件可达性 != unavailable]&#10;    D --&gt; E[软目标打分]&#10;    E --&gt; F{批量规模}&#10;    F --&gt;|单张单/规模小| G[贪心: 取最高分]&#10;    F --&gt;|批量/规模大| H[指派问题求解: 全局最优]&#10;    G --&gt; I[结果 + 解释]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[写入网点队列, 拉动备件需求]\">graph TD\n    A[待派单 J] --&gt; B[硬约束过滤: 能力/合规/地域]\n    B --&gt; C[硬约束过滤: 容量 ATP &gt; 0]\n    C --&gt; D[硬约束过滤: 备件可达性 != unavailable]\n    D --&gt; E[软目标打分]\n    E --&gt; F{批量规模}\n    F --&gt;|单张单/规模小| G[贪心: 取最高分]\n    F --&gt;|批量/规模大| H[指派问题求解: 全局最优]\n    G --&gt; I[结果 + 解释]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[写入网点队列, 拉动备件需求]</pre><p>这个流程图里的第一件事与最后一件事同样重要：<strong>先过滤，再打分</strong>。一个常见的实现错误是把所有条件都写成目标函数里的惩罚项——给&quot;能力不匹配&quot;加一个大权重，&quot;容量为负&quot;再加一个大权重。这看起来优雅（一个目标函数解决一切），但它有三个致命问题：惩罚权重之间的大小关系难以维持（新增一项就可能打破既有平衡）、分数的高低无法解释（用户问&quot;为什么派给它&quot;时只能回答&quot;它总分最高&quot;）、以及<strong>惩罚是可被跨越的</strong>——当某张单的所有候选网点都缺料时，分数最高的那个仍然会被选中，于是系统会把单派给一个注定修不了的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬约束与软目标的边界怎么画\">硬约束与软目标的边界怎么画</h2><p>判据很简单：<strong>如果一个条件被违反会产生一个无法通过后续补偿挽回的后果，它就是硬约束。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌授权 / 机型覆盖</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>越权维修会导致保修失效与厂商处罚，事后无法补救</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辖区与出口管制</td>\n<td>硬</td>\n<td>违法的物理后果不可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维修等级（L0–L3）</td>\n<td>软（成本项）</td>\n<td>L1 网点能用更高的零件成本完成任务，可补救</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>硬（带缓冲）</td>\n<td>超派会产生无法挽回的延迟，见 1.2 的队列水位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备件可达性</td>\n<td>分档</td>\n<td><code>available</code>/<code>reachable</code> 通过；<code>long-lead</code> 触发调拨；<code>unavailable</code> 硬否决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离 / 时效 / 成本</td>\n<td>软</td>\n<td>存在更优解但次优解可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户偏好（上门/语言/备用机）</td>\n<td>软（可加价）</td>\n<td>偏好可被补偿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最有争议的一格是维修等级。它之所以是软约束，是因为一个只具备 L1 的网点仍然能修好机器，只是要用一整块主板替换坏元件，成本更高。把成本差异显式写进目标函数，让系统在&quot;寄到远处做 L2 板级维修&quot;与&quot;就近做 L1 整块替换&quot;之间做真实的权衡，比为它设一个硬门槛更符合业务。但这个权衡的成立有一个前提：<strong>成本差异必须在目标函数里被正确量化</strong>——如果 L1 的零件成本是 L2 的五倍而目标函数里只给了一个笼统的&quot;等级差距&quot;罚分，权衡就会失真。</p>\n<p>备件可达性的分档处理是这张表的另一个要点。它展示了硬约束与软目标之间的第三种状态：<strong>条件分支</strong>。<code>long-lead</code> 既不是直接通过也不是直接否决，而是触发一个子决策（调拨），子决策的结果决定它是否通过。这种&quot;触发动作再判定&quot;的约束在实现上应当是一个可插拔的判定器，而不是目标函数里的一项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标函数的构成与归一化\">目标函数的构成与归一化</h2><p>一旦硬约束筛完之后，剩下的候选通常是个位数。此时目标函数要把四个量纲不同的项折叠成一个标量。做法是先把每一项归一化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再加权求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Score(p \\mid j) = w_d \\cdot \\tilde{d}(p,j) + w_t \\cdot \\tilde{t}(p,j) + w_c \\cdot \\tilde{c}(p,j) - w_l \\cdot \\tilde{L}(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1813em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1702em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是距离（或更准确地说，往返物流里程）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺时效、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是完成成本（人工 + 备件差 + 双向物流 + 关税）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是网点的当前负载率。前三项越小越好，负载项<strong>取负号</strong>是因为它越大越好（把单派给空闲的网点有助于整体利用率与时效稳定）。</p>\n<p>归一化必须在<strong>同一张单的候选集合内</strong>做，而不是用一个全局的绝对尺度。理由是：绝对尺度会把所有单都倾向于派给同一个明星网点，而候选内相对尺度天然实现了负载均衡——同样两台网点，空闲的那个在负载项上得分更高。用最小值—最大值归一化时要注意候选集只有一个网点或所有网点数值相同时的除零，这两种情形应当直接返回该网点而不是产生 <code>NaN</code>。</p>\n<p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 不能是拍出来的常数。它们应当体现<strong>业务当前的目标</strong>：在扩张期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（时效）权重高；在成本压缩期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 权重高；在市场饱和度高的地区，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（负载）权重高以避免压垮优质网点。这意味着权重必须是配置项而非代码常量，并且每次调整都要能被记录与回溯——因为权重一旦调错，影响的是全局的分派质量，而它不会立刻暴露。权重的效果验证依赖第四章的时效数据，见 <a href=\"../service-level-ops/repair-cycle-time\">维修周期与 SLA 时效</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标项</th>\n<th>常用代理指标</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>双向物流里程或预估运费</td>\n<td>用直线距离而在跨境场景下失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>网点承诺的返修天数</td>\n<td>用网点承诺值而非历史实际达成值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>人工 + 备件差 + 物流 + 关税</td>\n<td>漏算关税与双向物流，只算人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WIP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> / 日产能</td>\n<td>用瞬时值导致抖动，应做平滑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"单张贪心与批量全局指派\">单张贪心与批量全局指派</h2><p>单张单到达时逐个做贪心（每张单各自取最高分）实现简单，但它有一个已知的退化：当一批单同时到达时，贪心会让所有单挤向同一个高分网点，直到它被填满再溢出到次优——结果往往比全局最优差很多。</p>\n<p>批量场景（例如一次促销后的集中报修、或每日批量重新分派）应当用<strong>全局指派</strong>：把&quot;待派单 × 候选网点&quot;构造成代价矩阵，用匈牙利算法或其变体求最小代价的匹配，并把容量约束处理成网点可被匹配的次数上限。这类问题的规模通常可控：候选集在硬约束过滤后是个位数，网点池在几百量级，可以分市场分片求解。</p>\n<p>一个实用的折中是<strong>滚动批量</strong>：不是来一张派一张，而是把 30 秒到几分钟内到达的单聚成一个小批，对这一批做一次指派。这个窗口的大小是一个纯粹的权衡——窗口越大解越优但用户等待越久。对于售后场景，几十秒的窗口通常完全可接受，因为用户本来就要等待受理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[单张到达] --&gt; B{批窗口内?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[入批缓冲]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[立即贪心分派]&#10;    C --&gt; E[窗口到期]&#10;    E --&gt; F[构造代价矩阵]&#10;    F --&gt; G[带容量上限的最小代价指派]&#10;    G --&gt; H[写回网点队列]&#10;    H --&gt; I[未匹配的单 → 重算时效或转处置]\">graph TD\n    A[单张到达] --&gt; B{批窗口内?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[入批缓冲]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[立即贪心分派]\n    C --&gt; E[窗口到期]\n    E --&gt; F[构造代价矩阵]\n    F --&gt; G[带容量上限的最小代价指派]\n    G --&gt; H[写回网点队列]\n    H --&gt; I[未匹配的单 → 重算时效或转处置]</pre><h2 id=\"分派结果的可解释与可申诉\">分派结果的可解释与可申诉</h2><p>分派决策一旦产生外部后果（网点被要求接单、用户被承诺时效），它就必须可解释。可用的做法是让分派器为每个决策<strong>留下打分明细</strong>：每个候选的四个分项值、加权后的总分、以及被硬约束排除的候选与排除原因。</p>\n<p>这份明细有三个不可替代的用途。第一是<strong>对网点申诉</strong>：网点认为派单不公时，可以核对是不是因为它的负载率被高估。第二是<strong>对用户解释</strong>：当用户问&quot;为什么我的机器要寄到另一个国家&quot;，答案应当是&quot;本地网点不具备 L2 能力且 L2 的成本低于 L1 整块替换&quot;这样一句话，而不是&quot;系统选的&quot;。第三是<strong>对系统自身的调试</strong>：当分派质量下降时，能看出是权重错了、输入数据错了，还是硬约束的范围错了。</p>\n<p>存储这份明细的成本不高（每条几百字节），而它带来的可审计性是整个分派系统能被长期信任的基础。缺少它，任何一次分派质量的下降都会变成无法定位的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与处置分流-跨境路由的接口\">与处置分流、跨境路由的接口</h2><p>本篇处理的是&quot;已经确定要维修、且在国内&quot;的分派。两个边界需要明确。</p>\n<p><strong>上游是处置分流</strong>：什么请求走维修、什么走换新、什么走退款，由 <a href=\"repair-vs-exchange-route\">维修/换新/退款路由</a> 决定。本片的输入是&quot;已判定为维修&quot;的请求。但两者共享同一份供给侧事实（能力、容量、备件可达性），因为处置判定本身需要知道&quot;附近有没有网点能修&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>变体是跨境情形</strong>：当候选集里的最优解在另一个国家时，三组新约束（关税与清关、跨境合规、数据边界）会进入决策，这由 <a href=\"cross-border-service-route\">跨境寄修网点路由</a> 处理。本篇的目标函数骨架在那里被复用，但他的硬约束集合会被显著扩大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分派是一道<strong>带硬约束的指派问题</strong>；正确顺序是<strong>先过滤再打分</strong>，把所有条件都写成惩罚项会让硬性否决被分数跨越。</li>\n<li>硬约束与软目标的边界判据是&quot;违反后是否可补偿&quot;：品牌授权与辖区是硬的，维修等级是成本项，备件可达性分档处理并触发子决策。</li>\n<li>目标函数把距离、时效、成本、负载四项归一化后加权求和，<strong>负载项取负号</strong>；归一化应在候选集内做以天然实现负载均衡。</li>\n<li>权重是体现业务目标的配置项而非代码常量，每次调整都要可回溯；其效果验证依赖第四章的时效度量。</li>\n<li>批量场景应当用<strong>全局指派</strong>（带容量上限的最小代价匹配）而不是贪心，滚动批窗口是&quot;解的质量 vs 用户等待&quot;的权衡。</li>\n<li>分派决策必须留下<strong>打分明细</strong>，以支撑网点申诉、用户解释与系统调试——这是分派系统被长期信任的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按距离/能力/容量智能分派","id":"按距离-能力-容量智能分派"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"硬约束与软目标的边界怎么画","id":"硬约束与软目标的边界怎么画"},{"level":2,"text":"目标函数的构成与归一化","id":"目标函数的构成与归一化"},{"level":2,"text":"单张贪心与批量全局指派","id":"单张贪心与批量全局指派"},{"level":2,"text":"分派结果的可解释与可申诉","id":"分派结果的可解释与可申诉"},{"level":2,"text":"与处置分流、跨境路由的接口","id":"与处置分流-跨境路由的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网点备件可用性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-network-capacity/spare-parts-availability"},"next":{"title":"维修/换新/退款路由（接 57/29）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-network-ops/service-dispatch/repair-vs-exchange-route"}}